    <title>A JWST view of
  compact star-forming galaxies at z&gt;10</title>
    <summary>  We present JWST/NIRSpec spectroscopy of a sample of galaxies at high
redshift. The objects are compact and
metal-poor. We discuss implications for reionization.
</summary>
